<title>SWEDEN: Free Swedish newspaper to be launched overseas.</title>
<headline>Free Swedish newspaper to be launched overseas.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Modern Times Group (MTG), a unit of media company Kinnevik, said on Tuesday it was to launch its free newspaper, Metro, overseas.</p>
<p>The paper, which is available in underground stations in Stockholm, will be launched in Prague in the Czech Republic.</p>
